# 高频词汇 List10
# 领域: 考研
# 学科: 英语词汇
# 来源: 2023恋练有词
# 描述: 高频词汇List10核心词汇

{{community}}{/kəˈmjuːnəti/}{社区；群体}{The local community organized a charity event.}}
{{comparable}}{/ˈkɒmpərəbl/}{可比较的；类似的}{The quality is comparable to that of more expensive brands.}}
{{compensate}}{/ˈkɒmpenseɪt/}{补偿；赔偿}{The company compensated the workers for their overtime.}}
{{compete}}{/kəmˈpiːt/}{竞争；比赛}{Small businesses struggle to compete with large corporations.}}
{{complex}}{/ˈkɒmpleks/}{复杂的；综合体}{The issue is more complex than it appears.}}
{{component}}{/kəmˈpəʊnənt/}{组成部分；零件}{Each component of the machine must function properly.}}
{{comprehensive}}{/ˌkɒmprɪˈhensɪv/}{全面的；综合的}{The report provides a comprehensive analysis of the market.}}
{{concentrate}}{/ˈkɒnsntreɪt/}{集中；浓缩}{She concentrated on her studies for the final exam.}}
{{concept}}{/ˈkɒnsept/}{概念；观念}{The concept of democracy has evolved over centuries.}}
{{conclude}}{/kənˈkluːd/}{得出结论；结束}{The study concluded that exercise reduces stress.}}
{{conduct}}{/kənˈdʌkt/}{进行；行为}{The researchers conducted a series of experiments.}}
{{conference}}{/ˈkɒnfərəns/}{会议；讨论会}{The annual conference attracted over 500 attendees.}}
{{confirm}}{/kənˈfɜːm/}{确认；证实}{The results confirmed the initial hypothesis.}}
{{conflict}}{/ˈkɒnflɪkt/}{冲突；矛盾}{The conflict between the two countries lasted for years.}}
{{confront}}{/kənˈfrʌnt/}{面对；对抗}{We must confront the challenges of climate change.}}
{{confuse}}{/kənˈfjuːz/}{使困惑；混淆}{The similar names often confuse people.}}
{{congress}}{/ˈkɒŋɡres/}{国会；代表大会}{Congress passed the new healthcare bill.}}
{{consequence}}{/ˈkɒnsɪkwəns/}{后果；结果}{Pollution is a consequence of industrialization.}}
{{conservative}}{/kənˈsɜːvətɪv/}{保守的；守旧的}{The party holds conservative views on social issues.}}
{{considerable}}{/kənˈsɪdərəbl/}{相当大的；重要的}{The project required a considerable amount of time.}}
{{consist}}{/kənˈsɪst/}{由...组成；在于}{The team consists of five researchers.}}
{{constant}}{/ˈkɒnstənt/}{持续的；恒定的}{The temperature remains constant throughout the day.}}
{{constitute}}{/ˈkɒnstɪtjuːt/}{构成；组成}{Women constitute more than half of the population.}}
{{construct}}{/kənˈstrʌkt/}{建造；构建}{The bridge was constructed in just two years.}}
{{consult}}{/kənˈsʌlt/}{咨询；查阅}{You should consult a doctor before taking any medication.}}
{{consume}}{/kənˈsjuːm/}{消耗；消费}{Modern lifestyles consume vast amounts of energy.}}
{{contact}}{/ˈkɒntækt/}{联系；接触}{Please contact us if you have any questions.}}
{{contain}}{/kənˈteɪn/}{包含；控制}{The report contains important findings.}}
{{contemporary}}{/kənˈtemprəri/}{当代的；同时代的}{The gallery features contemporary art from around the world.}}
{{context}}{/ˈkɒntekst/}{上下文；背景}{The meaning of a word depends on its context.}}
